          "hasStatus": "launch:status-done",
          "note": "Met its Phase III primary endpoint in KALUMA (NCT05842954): 97.4% PCR-corrected cure at Day 29 vs 94.0% for artemether–lumefantrine (Coartem), in adults and children ≥10 kg. Company-reported; not yet peer-reviewed. Registry: 1,720 participants, 33 sites, 12 African countries, completed 25 Nov 2025.",
