      "changeText": "Version 2 preview: first collected-data updates from the public-source staging layer (Global Fund PQR extract 23 Aug 2026, WHO PQ lists, EMA EU-M4all table, ClinicalTrials.gov)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://kochrisdev.github.io/launch-transparency-dashboard/ontology/launch-data.jsonld#change-31",
